Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《揭露》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到一个曾经高高在上的人 落魄至此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wounds my heart, to see a man once so elevated,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}plummet to such depths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那个狗腿子Ashur\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your dog Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他向我摇尾乞怜的那一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he always upon your leash,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你授命的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even when licking my ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他忠贞不二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His loyalty never wavered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此人骗人不偿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man is most skilled in deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者你只是一厢情愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or perhaps you were too blinded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愿认清事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by envy to perceive the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自欺欺人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You flatter yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你就没垂涎过我的训练场?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you not have eyes towards my ludus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的战神?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My champions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.49,0:01:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我老婆?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妄想掠夺Batiatus家族的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would steal glory from the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜现在偷鸡不着蚀把米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet here you are with nothing but blood and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好凄凉呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sand for your efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚民众 迟早会认清你是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Capua will see you for what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将谋害行政官的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man who brought the Magistrate's murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳之以法的民族英雄?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to justice, a hero of the people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 愿天神保佑我 不要受池鱼之殃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, may the gods protect me from their wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus三两下就能干掉对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus makes quick work of his opponent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得回上席...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must return to the pulvinus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去宣布你的处决令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to announce your execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戏演得真好 Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well played, Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我低估你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I underestimated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是第一个栽跟头的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not the first to die for that mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为你而战!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus为追念您丈夫 争得了荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus honors the memory of your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应当抛却伤心的过往...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should put these dark times behind us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以Solonius之血...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with Solonius' blood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来祭奠我们的伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}amend our grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus! Crixus 万岁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus! Crixus! Crixus 万岁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus! Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要求跟Batiatus说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I request words with Batiatus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果你却一个人回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet you return absent the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有其它事在忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Other matters occupy his attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让民众整整一周难以忘怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've pressed for audience all week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人却忘了他的战神是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus forgets who his champion is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你忘了身份才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is you who forgets title,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了主人和奴隶的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}master and slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为战神后 我屡屡犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have made many mistakes since becoming Champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上去反省 改正错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that I intend to rectify them shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚的市民们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我站在你们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand before you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤痛欲绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the sting of tears yet hot upon my cheek,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要惩治一个罪大恶极的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to redress a most vile crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人民公敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against our city and our hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是谋杀Titus Calavius行政官的凶手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The murder of Magistrate Titus Calavius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此人利欲熏心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His life stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不惜痛下杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for lust of profit and advancement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让慈祥睿智的行政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His warmth and guidance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}torn from our hands...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他亲爱的妻儿 天人永隔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and those of loving wife and noble son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天让我们见证正义的裁决!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet today we shall witness justice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤我们至深的卑劣罪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The base criminal that has so wounded us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将在角斗场受到处决!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall be executed at gladium!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Solonius入场!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enter Solonius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人民公敌!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enemy of the people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无耻之徒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking pig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背信弃义的小人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扯烂他的舌头!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slice his traitor tongue off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死马屁精!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fucking pig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该由谁来执行处决呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who shall balance the scales?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁又能让我们的城市重归光荣呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who shall restore honor to our city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯! 斯巴达克斯! 斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is but one man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡之影的屠灭者!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Slayer of Theokoles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送雨的使者!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Bringer of Rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在处决中逃过一死 色雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You survived your execution, Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时正是在这片沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon these very sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许Solonius也能将历史重演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps good Solonius will fare as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒觉得希望渺茫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not expect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的 来打我啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fight me, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么斯巴达克斯不还手?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does Spartacus not strike in return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这么做 有助于刺激民众怒焰滔天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He but extends the moment, to the favor of the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个恶棍马上就会伏法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The villain's blood will flow soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丈夫真像天神赐下的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband has been a gift from the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有他的帮忙 Numerius肯定茫然无措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Numerius would be lost without his support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场角斗赛 能让他得到莫大的安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gains great comfort in the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都深感安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The comfort is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有朝一日 他也会成为一位好父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will make a fine father, when the day comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 斯巴达克斯砍到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, Spartacus draws blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有角斗功底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not absent skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有生存的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor desire to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧见了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Solonius玩儿完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Solonius comes to his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是众望所归么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who would not wish it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丈夫的去世 令罗马的街上 泪流成河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The streets of Rome are wet with tears of your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ilithyia 你还没有答复我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have not received word from you, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你丈夫说过了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you speak to your husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于资助Batiatus家族的事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About patronage for the House of Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得很详细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At length.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他明天会来卡普亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He comes to Capua a day hence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自商讨此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to discuss the matter personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民众的呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The roar of the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再没有比这更荣耀的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no sound more glorious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你能听到的 最后的呼声了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The last you shall hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟错了人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You take the wrong life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的主人Batiatus 是个恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your master Batiatus, is the villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不久 他就会跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And shall join you presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他! 杀了他! 杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯! 斯巴达克斯! 斯巴达克斯! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus! Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让Agron为了兄弟情义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have Agron risk himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on behalf of brotherly bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将来 让他和Duro分开角斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See him separated from Duro in future games. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 斯巴达克斯呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, what of Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人召见 让他焦躁不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He grows restless at not receiving audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,审判Solonius让我焦头烂额\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The proceedings with Solonius have filled my attentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让Mira去抚慰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send Mira to occupy his thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明早我再传召他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will summon him in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长袍 尊显出智者的高贵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robes, fit for a man of breeding and intelligence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很衬你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wear them well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天看到Solonius引颈被戮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Today beheld the end of Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,场面之壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A welcomed spectacle, given purchase{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:10:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全拜你的忠诚和狡黠所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by your loyalty and cunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该立即离开训练场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall be removed from the ludus immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Removed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住到庄园去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll reside in the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地位高升 远离贱民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elevated far above the common men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让自己的狡黠才智 更有用武之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your devious fucking mind close to elbow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感激得说不出话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude seizes the tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 或许来个小妞 可以帮你重现辩才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well perhaps a woman will aid in the untangling of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手下的女奴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Name any slave, and the wet joys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你挑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of her body are yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认 我的确有所需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I confess to certain longings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要个没被别人玩过的小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For one not yet soiled by the other men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我名字 我帮你达成心愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give name to your desire, and see it fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人叫我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My presence was commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他派我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His words set me to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我很高兴...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they were gladly received...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我照顾受伤的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tend your wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你犯下命案的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand guard at your request while you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我遵照你的要求 帮你放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stain hands with blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你连碰都不让我碰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you discard a simple touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My mind is taken with other thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不妨告诉我是什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then break open head and share them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕Batiatus在怀疑 我和Aulus的死有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear Batiatus suspects my hand in Aulus' death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎没这意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He appears absent the weight of pressing concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他为何不召见我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why does he not grant me audience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aulus断气前 到底说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What secrets did Aulus reveal in dying breath,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你如此愤怒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that so inflamed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了Sura\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That his hand robbed Sura of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是奉Batiatus之命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By command of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想复仇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You plan vengeance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不要这样做!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯巴达克斯...  - 她不是这么叫我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Spartacus...  - That is not what she called me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也听不到她呢喃我的真名了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never again will I hear her whisper my true name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也感受不到 爱人呢喃的欢乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or taste the joy of it on her lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要看着他一败涂地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see the light fade from his eyes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我妻子偿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or join her in the attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕赔上我的命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At expense of my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个色雷斯人 根本不懂罗马律法!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Thracian does not know Roman law!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有一个奴隶杀了主人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If one slave spills the blood of his master...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的奴隶都得陪葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all are put to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人人都有自己的宿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each to his own fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是狂野...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move with strong purpose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全拜你的胜利所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spurred, by your victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我打败Pericles的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I defeated Pericles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不在上席...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you were not in the pulvinus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有你的注视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no meaning to glory,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荣耀毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without your eyes to witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以后会一直注视着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will never again be absent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Naevia啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Naevia啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在忙些什么 叫了半天也没人影?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What business do you attend, that you do not answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 我在拿酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fetching wine, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没听到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, I did not hear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管酒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人要你办件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is a service required of you by Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你 真让我心跳不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My heart quickens at such a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你大可放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set mind to ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会既往不咎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cling to no grudge for past transgressions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说Barca获得自由后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You spoke with Doctore,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和Doctore谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after it was said Barca secured his freedom.{\r}
