Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们谈拢了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So all is well between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和斯巴达克斯单独说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I require words with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.92,0:23:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈凭什么答应你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why the fuck would I allow that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我始终为你遗失门钥一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because my tongue remains silent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保守秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}towards the gate key you lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不想我说出来吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would have it remain so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机会就摆在你眼前 可你却放过了Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Opportunity presents itself, yet Batiatus lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚 这房子里其他奴隶的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last night the lives of every slave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还根本不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under this roof meant nothing to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着Aurelia出现了 然后你居然就有了良心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then Aurelia appears, and you grow a conscience!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Varro是我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varro was as a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让他的妻子受到伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not see his wife put at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你杀死了她丈夫的时候 她就已经受到伤害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You put the woman at risk when you killed her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.39,0:24:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一份告别礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A parting gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.52,0:24:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.29,0:24:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟Theokoles战斗的纪念品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A memento of your battle with Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从斯巴达克斯带来雨水之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city was filled with such novelties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.36,0:24:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这城市到处都是这种小饰品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Spartacus brought the rains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.13,0:24:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 制作工艺很粗糙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The craftsmanship was rather poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.72,0:24:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人终于决定把你从角斗士中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus finally decides to remove you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.89,0:24:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调出来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the company of men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.39,0:24:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调得可远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.39,0:24:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人在庄园里 给我安排了岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been given favored quarters within the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.89,0:24:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在已经成了他的得力助手啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To serve as our master's right hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是他擦屁股的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The one he wipes his ass with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 用词用得多妙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, a witty turn of phrase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.59,0:25:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会想念作为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of many splendors I shall miss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.39,0:25:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,角斗士的荣耀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of being a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可从没当过角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were never a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.86,0:25:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全拜你刺我大腿那一刀所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not after your blade found itself in my leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当我送你的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My gift to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送完之后 确实让我得益不少啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that has given great reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything I am,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所拥有的一切 都是拜你所赐啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything I now possess, I owe to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 把它放在阳台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, that goes to the balcony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧 副将就要到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly, the Legatus arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.52,0:25:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新人做事 真叫人不满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The new girl is slow to the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厚道点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An act of charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.42,0:25:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮她找一个适合的岗位吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall yet find proper use for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大日子啊 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great day, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一天将永被铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that shall be remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副将人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the Legatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.22,0:26:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我丈夫有事耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies. My husband is delayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.76,0:26:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你答应过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you made promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我会遵守的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which will be well kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还是会来拜访的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He yet intends proper visit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但得请Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but requests good Batiatus give greeting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去城门迎接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon entering the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.96,0:26:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荣幸之至!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么时候到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When does he arrive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.92,0:26:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.39,0:26:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们得赶紧了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.82,0:26:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们到阳台去享用美食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us retire to the balcony to feast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.16,0:26:35.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后好好检讨一下你的时间观念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And review your sense of timing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would love nothing more,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.82,0:26:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我必须赶回庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I must return to the villa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.56,0:26:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去收拾一下东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to gather my belongings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾来干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.39,0:26:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要搬回罗马了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm moving back to Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你在卡普亚还没住多久啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But your stay in Capua has been so brief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Painfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.22,0:26:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我丈夫还要为执政官打仗啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet now that my husband campaigns for praetor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他坚持让我陪在他身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he insists I remain at his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.79,0:27:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脸色好苍白啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The blood drains from your cheeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.86,0:27:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一想到你要走...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My heart but flutters at the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心里就堵得慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the thought of losing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.62,0:27:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩在一起的美好记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Memories of our time together will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想忘都难啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fade only with difficulty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.72,0:27:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lucretia 你的友谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your friendship, Lucretia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.39,0:27:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经彻底改变了我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has forever altered my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.72,0:27:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.72,0:27:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would make request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找别人吧 我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask another, if you seek it granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是为我 而是为了我兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not for me, but for my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus下令我们分开角斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus orders us parted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.16,0:28:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Duro听到这消息 开心死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Duro greets the news with laugh and fucking smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.49,0:28:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我担心他独自一人 无法在竞技场活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I fear he shall not survive the arena on his own. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not alone in the thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.22,0:28:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus非常看重你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus shows you much favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.42,0:28:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你帮我们说个情 他就能收回成命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word from your lips could see the decision undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.32,0:28:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus除了自己 谁也不看重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus favors no one but himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.69,0:28:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看! 是副将啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah! The Legatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.76,0:29:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber副将!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legatus Glaber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.09,0:29:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的到来 真是令卡普亚城荣光无限啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your arrival honors the fair city of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你会到城门口来迎接我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An honor I expected matched by greeting at the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不好意思 我还以为是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well apologies. I had thought that..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事姑且不论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us move past it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.59,0:29:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我上次走后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My ears burn with reports of lawlessness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.92,0:29:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里越来越目无法纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since last I visited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.56,0:29:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官的死实属不幸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Magistrate's murder was unfortunate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.76,0:29:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对于Ovidius和他的家族 更是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As was that of Ovidius and his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.03,0:29:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在 Crassus议员的表亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now the cousin of Senator Crassus{\r}
