Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.09,0:35:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就不用让他承受父亲的债务了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be raised free of his father's debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.36,0:35:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他母亲不在身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.16,0:35:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怀的孩子怎样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the child in carry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.99,0:35:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不是Varro的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was not fathered by Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.83,0:35:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有他 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without him I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.16,0:35:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不去想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had it removed from my concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.69,0:35:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会再去想你所做的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would be from yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别相信Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus is not to be trusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.09,0:35:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别对他有任何的信赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not lay faith in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.46,0:35:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的丈夫死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.26,0:35:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的信赖也就跟着死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with him all faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如您所见 装修庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As your eyes witness, no coin has been spared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可毫不吝啬啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in restoring the villa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.49,0:35:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人进来 都会感到震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All will marvel upon privileged entry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.42,0:35:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在有名的Batiatus家族历史前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and be humbled by the storied history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.52,0:35:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感到卑微!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the house of Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:35:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改变真是不小啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a vast improvement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 众神真是眷顾他们啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hm, the gods have truly blessed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.89,0:36:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后也会一直眷顾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And continue to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.89,0:36:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如此地受到眷顾 为什么还要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If fortune so favors, why do you continue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.52,0:36:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么肆无忌惮地 寻求我的帮助?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to press so brazenly for my support?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.89,0:36:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再大的眷顾也大不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}True fortune extends no further than{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.72,0:36:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个男人的野心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a man's ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.13,0:36:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我的野心 远大于这竞技场的黄沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine stretch well beyond the sands of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.02,0:36:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是多大呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How far beyond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.36,0:36:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直通行政部的门前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the very doors of political office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.16,0:36:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 还是要走出一小步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a minor capacity. At first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们晚点再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, let us entertain it for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是何种地位的人给了你这般自信?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What men of status lend you their confidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.59,0:36:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在懦夫Solonius杀害行政官Calavius之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Magistrate Calavius had voiced his endorsement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.69,0:36:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官就已经声明了对我的认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before the coward Solonius forever stilled his tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.06,0:36:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卑劣恶徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Base villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.32,0:36:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他露出尖齿那副死相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The way he would stare with his teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.76,0:36:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听闻这件悲剧 我深为所动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My heart is moved by the tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.89,0:36:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好在项上人头尚在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet my head remains fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.29,0:36:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我与一个角斗士主结盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What advantage would I gain by association{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.72,0:36:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能得到什么好处?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a lanista?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.13,0:36:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的角斗士令民众群情激荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My gladiators ignite the passion of the crowd,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.89,0:37:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使我得以达成我愿 他们雷鸣般的欢呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lend name to my cause, and see their deafening cheers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是Claudius Glaber你所需之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}transformed into demands for Claudius Glaber,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.13,0:37:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮你早日获取执政官之位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his desired position of Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.19,0:37:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们非常喜欢Batiatus的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do favor Batiatus' men like no others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.39,0:37:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Especially Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.89,0:37:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.49,0:37:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手下最低劣的士兵 却成为你最骁勇的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what does it say that your finest gladiator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.72,0:37:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这又该怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was my worst soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.79,0:37:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是共和国最伟大的 角斗士主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I am the greatest lanista in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.29,0:37:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我捕获蛮兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For I have taken a wild beast,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.69,0:37:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并将他们锻造成神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and forged him into a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是大言不惭啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its a bold claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.13,0:37:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是言出有据啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Built on a foundation of fucking granite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.62,0:37:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒想看看你是怎样做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see your words made flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.36,0:37:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻而易举啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Easily conjured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.82,0:37:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯同其余人一样在场上训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus trains in the square with the other men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.69,0:37:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经到过你这角斗场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have descended into the bowels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.06,0:37:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时可没注意到有这么个烂货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of your Ludus once before, and did not care for the stench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传召那色雷斯人和你其他手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Summon the Thracian to the villa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.52,0:37:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起到庄园来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}along with the rest of your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.76,0:38:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.46,0:38:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个低等劣奴被冠之以如此头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sad day when an honored city elevates a cur{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.52,0:38:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真使这座荣耀之城蒙羞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to such position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.36,0:38:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你已经教过那个劣奴不可多嘴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see you've taught the animal not to speak out of turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.02,0:38:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想再看看这色雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have demonstration of other tricks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.26,0:38:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学到的其他诀窍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Thracian has learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他解开锁链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unchain him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.02,0:39:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想派我哪个手下去与他对抗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which of my men would you have oppose him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也不派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.62,0:39:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯手持训练剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus wields practice swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.99,0:39:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕对他不利啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear he's at a disadvantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.56,0:39:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是给他机会 让他证实传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but give him chance to prove his legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.89,0:39:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Iovis出列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iovis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.13,0:39:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.42,0:39:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开战!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.06,0:40:05.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Vesper! 还有Linus!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vesper! Linus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.66,0:40:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副将...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legatus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.66,0:40:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你打开的这扇门 角斗士主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You opened this door, lanista.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.89,0:40:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正要从此通过呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall pass through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.36,0:42:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Behold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.02,0:42:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传奇已被证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The legend is proved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.13,0:42:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.72,0:42:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个野蛮人 曾令罗马蒙羞!!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This savage caused Rome great offense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.16,0:42:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来 你已经驯服他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it would appear that you have broken the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.56,0:42:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧他低眉顺眼的样儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The way he bows his head in deference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.59,0:42:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒想知道 如果我资助你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would I be afforded such courtesies, I wonder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.02,0:42:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是否也会对我如此顺从?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if patronage were awarded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.32,0:42:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以及我的手下 都将唯你是从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would be yours to command, as would all my men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.46,0:43:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.39,0:43:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正当如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it shall be so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.66,0:43:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副将大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.16,0:44:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.19,0:44:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个混账!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fucking cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.29,0:44:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.09,0:44:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奴隶们都疯了吗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slaves running wild!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.36,0:44:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你赖以成名的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is what you would have me give name towards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎敢肆意妄为? 说啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What seizes your fucking wits? Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.02,0:44:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在品尝我的礼物 Crixus就发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I yet but touch my gift, and Crixus goes mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.69,0:44:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们同床共枕时 她的贞操早已荡然无存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt her maidenhood long absent when we lay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.96,0:44:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我知道是谁第一个上的她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I know whose cock was in her first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.23,0:44:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个贱货!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You whore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.13,0:44:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.13,0:44:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How fucking long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.19,0:44:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直以来表面服帖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long have you hidden laughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.39,0:44:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背地里却在暗自窃喜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}behind a polite smile!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你勾引他 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long have you been luring him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.19,0:44:49.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他上你这贱女 多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to your filthy slave cunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.49,0:44:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么? 这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.02,0:45:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我 拿来给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it to me. Give it to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.16,0:45:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从哪儿得来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you come by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.86,0:45:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偷拿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.29,0:45:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开门 你好和Crixus私通是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To open the gate. So you could lie with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.42,0:45:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你一人知道我对他的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You alone knew of my feelings for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.29,0:45:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却依然背叛我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet you betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.39,0:45:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus从未爱过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus never loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.69,0:45:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是奉命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did only as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.69,0:45:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mira啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mira!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.56,0:45:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.96,0:45:46.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我拿把刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring me a knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.23,0:45:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们肯定会严惩Crixus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have assurance Crixus will be punished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.82,0:45:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕你会有所偏袒 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear your hands too soft for the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:45:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了 他们如铁一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are mistaken. They are as steel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.59,0:46:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻木不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hardened to their purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.66,0:46:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.46,0:46:04.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要回罗马 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We return to Rome, absent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.02,0:46:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离这纷争烦扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unworthy entanglements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.32,0:46:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not turn from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.36,0:46:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了你啥身份 角斗士主人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forget your place, lanista!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.39,0:46:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我没忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I secure it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.96,0:46:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把屋子给我打扫干净!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear the fucking room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉Ashur 让他把礼物给副将送去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell Ashur to bring our gift for the Legatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.76,0:46:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礼物就免了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forget your gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.39,0:46:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把这当做一场噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would part as from a troubling dream,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此抛诸脑后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}untethered by the memory of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.13,0:46:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你会记住今天的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh you will remember this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.32,0:46:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到倒下长眠 再也无法醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until you lay to slumber, never to awaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.56,0:46:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得 我们已经尽了最大努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear we have let events run the best of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.52,0:46:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许来杯小酒 可以让我们冷静下头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps a cup of wine to er, cool the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.19,0:46:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里简直就是荒蛮之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are long past civilized recourse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.46,0:46:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丈夫一直紧迫逼人 我倒想看看如何收场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband presses issue. I would see it closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.19,0:46:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As would I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西 能令结果有所不同?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I believe this will make a difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.29,0:46:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开瞧瞧呗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open it and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.66,0:46:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这恶心的东西是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this abomination?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.82,0:47:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Licinia躯体的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But a piece of the whole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.32,0:47:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.62,0:47:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是Crassus的表亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cousin of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.42,0:47:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了Licinia?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You murdered Licinia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.56,0:47:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是你妻子杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Your wife did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.42,0:47:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.42,0:47:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人手段 残忍至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most heinous act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.02,0:47:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来答应 要帮她隐瞒这事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I was content to help obscure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.76,0:47:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也答应 要帮我们求得你的资助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under promise of her aid in obtaining your favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.32,0:47:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 恐怕Licinia的尸体要重现天日了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I fear Licinia's body may resurface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.89,0:47:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者出现在贵宅大堂 如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the grounds of your villa, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.09,0:47:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想撕烂你的嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see the tongue ripped from your fucking mouth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.52,0:47:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕我的嘴烂了 也照样能吐露真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even so ruined, it would yet speak the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.26,0:47:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cladius啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cladius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.09,0:47:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要相信我 这事不是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot believe me capable of such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.66,0:47:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意资助了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Patronage is granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.96,0:48:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会留下一部分人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A portion of my men will remain stationed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.13,0:48:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证以后不再发生此类尴尬事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against further embarrassments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.66,0:48:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它的事 跟Ilithyia去谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make all other arrangements with Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.26,0:48:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会继续留在卡普亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will be remaining here in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.52,0:48:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.32,0:48:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒犯Batiatus家族的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No man is above retribution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.72,0:48:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for offenses committed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.96,0:48:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃过惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.26,0:48:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.82,0:48:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是身边的守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even the men that guard you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.13,0:48:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有任何欺瞒或胜任不力 都一样会获罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should they be guilty of deceit or incompetence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.89,0:48:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hector发现钥匙丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hector found his key removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.56,0:48:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是他的脑袋也跟着没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His head follows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.16,0:49:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错在我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fault lies in my own breast,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.26,0:49:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野心太大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with heart grown too large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没关注到这回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This cannot stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Claudius Glaber副将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legatus Claudius Glaber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.06,0:49:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是我们尊贵无比的资助人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is now our honored Patron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.19,0:49:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让我看到我的慷慨之错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he has opened my eyes to the error of my generosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.92,0:49:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须矫正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that demands correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.09,0:49:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咬牙忍痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Embrace the pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.16,0:49:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一能救你的法子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.13,0:50:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你和Crixus告一段落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expect your meetings with Crixus to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.82,0:50:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quintus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.06,0:50:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not fucking speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.69,0:50:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我当傻瓜 还没侮辱够我么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you would think me a fool is insult enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.56,0:50:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have always known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.42,0:50:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说是因为这样能让你开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And turned eye away only because it made you happy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.59,0:50:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也从不多想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and caused me no thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.56,0:50:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种日子结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those days have ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.92,0:50:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把注意力转移到诞育孩子这事上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set your attentions towards our child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.46,0:50:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他们看笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And do not see them stray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.16,0:50:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.19,0:51:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.96,0:51:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.09,0:51:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grant them a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.62,0:51:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾经是我们的战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was our Champion once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.62,0:51:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他值得如许尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Allow him such respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.49,0:51:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我毁了我们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have destroyed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.06,0:51:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们还活着啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We yet live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要把你带去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where do they take you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.19,0:51:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会争得自由的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will win my freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.72,0:52:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不找到你 我誓不罢休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not rest until I find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.16,0:52:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.49,0:52:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像Barca一样 他也在说自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He speaks of freedom, as did Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.39,0:52:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你 我会帮他争取自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you my word, that I shall aid him in the seeking of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.09,0:52:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你必须制止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. You must not let him broach the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.29,0:52:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca没有自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca was not freed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.99,0:52:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus took his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.46,0:52:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的 你们这些罗马混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck ass, you Roman cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.59,0:52:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut your fucking mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.29,0:52:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟他们硬碰硬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would caution softer words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.32,0:52:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里越来越他妈恶心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The shit keeps rising higher in this fucking hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.16,0:52:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许当愤怒达到顶峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it best not to be present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.09,0:52:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就自然会要发泄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when it fills the mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.52,0:53:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you speak of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.29,0:53:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I speak of nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.42,0:53:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没意思听上去像是想逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing sounds much like escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.52,0:53:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 "没意思" 如何能避过Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how would "Nothing" find way past Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.06,0:53:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他那些阴魂不散的罗马侍卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all his fucking Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.19,0:53:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is but one path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.03,0:53:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们杀出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We kill them all.{\r}
